# The whole far cell of the synthetic planet (all 240 seeds, log10 s = 0.2, log10 q = -5): no planetary caustic on
# the trajectory, but the large source still sends the points near the peak to the finite-source integration.
# About 3 minutes with the fast CPU build on an Apple M4 Pro.
photometry tests/regression/synthetic_planet.dat
in flux 0.2 0.2 1 -5 -5 1 log10
ncpus 1
